Package: flashdraft
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: rainbowcrr-sys <rainbowcrr-sys@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libx11-6, libxext6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libxrender1
Description: FlashDraft - LAN and Internet peer-to-peer file transfer
 FlashDraft transfers files directly between peers on a LAN or over the
 public Internet using manually exchanged offer codes and UDP hole punching.
